## How to Connect over USB

You mentioned wanting this to work over USB. Because your system already has `usbmuxd` installed (the daemon that handles iOS USB communication), **Weylus supports this out-of-the-box!**

**Steps to use over USB:**
1. Connect your iPad to your laptop using a USB cable. 
   *(Make sure you unlock your iPad and tap "Trust this Computer" if prompted)*
2. Launch **Weylus** from your application menu on your laptop.
3. Click the **"Start"** button in Weylus.
4. On your iPad, open **Safari** (it *must* be Safari, other browsers won't work well) and navigate to: `http://localhost:1701`
5. You should now see your computer screen on your iPad!

